			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100%" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="center" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Wailing Haze </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Decreases the target&#39;s attack speed. (Can only be focused on one target at a time) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Spirit Guide </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Summons a spirit guide to ressurect a priest. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Contagion </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Does Disease damage over-time to the target opponent. (Does additional Divine damage over-time if the target is a being of shadow) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Spectral Ward </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Applies a powerful ward (prevents Health damage) to a group member, and any remaining prevention, when the ward expires, is converted to instant Health replenishment. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Spiritual Seal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups hit points, divine, and noxious resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Phantasm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Area of effect hate reduce and has a chance to fear. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Druid/Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13.4 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Spirit of the Wolf </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Increases the run speed of the target party member. (Does not stack with Pathfinding abilities) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">14.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Wards of Spirit </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Wards (prevents Health damage) the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grey Wind </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals cold damage and reduces movement speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Eidolic Ward </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Wards (prevents Health damage) a group member. This replenishment does not have a casting time, nor does it cost Power, but it has a significant re-use timer. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mending Spirits </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cures trauma. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Auspice </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the Health and Power pools on the target party member. (Compatible with the Symbol spell line and most Power pool augmentation spells) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Totemic Aid </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instant heal also has a chance to cure noxious. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Healing Ritual </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Instantly heals the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Spirit of the Bull </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Increases Strength and Stamina attributes for all party members. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Expunge Elements </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Cures elemental effects. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shaman </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Spirit of the Badger </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups strength, ac, and noxious resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Baleful Countenance </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grants a Wraith form that increases Health and Power pools, increases Armor Class, grants See Hidden vision, and adds a chance for an additional melee special attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Yoppas Rodent Form </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants the caster rodent form. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Revulsion </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Decreases the targets intelligence, wisdom and strength. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Degeneration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Dereases the targets strength and stamina, also slows the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Contamination </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals poinson damage over time and reduces stamina. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Fuliginous Sphere </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does Disease damage over-time and decreases attack speed on the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Reanimate </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ressurects the target, can be used in combat. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Abominus </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants enduring breath and deals disease damage over time to attackers. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Curse of Shielding </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment placed on a target opponent that has a chance to ward the defender and does instant Disease damage to the attacker (target of the impairment). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">26.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Spectral Guard </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Applies a powerful ward (prevents Health damage) to a group member, and any remaining prevention, when the ward expires, is converted to instant Health replenishment. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Devigorating Chant </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Reduces hate while draining power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Tainted Orison </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cures arcane effects and increases power regen. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Vile Imprecation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals disease damage and reduces arcane and noxious resistantces. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Profane Accretion </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instantly heals the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Distill Soul </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment placed on a target opponent that creates a soul essence crystal in the caster&#39;s inventory if the target opponent is killed while the impairment is active. A soul essence crystal will replenish Health instantly on the user of the crystal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Putridied Balm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instantly heals the target and deals damage over time to attackers. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Foreboding </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Decreases hitpoints, power, and defensive skills of the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Dire Effluence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups maximum hit points and wards against noxious damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Wunshis Foul Sickness </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Temporarily forces another person to be sick. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Seeping Eschar </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Wards the group and damage warded heals the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Aphotic Touch </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Does Disease damage over-time and decreases Noxious mitigation on the target and surrounding encounter members within the area of effect. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Sacraficial Aid </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">heals the target but decreases the casters hit points. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Dire Shroud </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups strength and ac, also has a chance to heal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Vehemence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups strength and stamina, can also reduce the attackers offensive skills when hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Sinister Countenance </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Grants a Wraith form that increases Health and Power pools, increases Armor Class, grants See Hidden vision, and adds a chance for an additional melee special attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Tendrils of Fear </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation placed on each party member that has a chance to decrease Attack Speed and Agility on the attacker per successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Loathing </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">? </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">37 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Suppuration </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals poison damage over time and reduces the targets stamina. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Atrophy </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Slows the target and decreases strength and stamina. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">38.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Fuliginous Coil </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does Disease damage over-time and decreases attack speed on the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Primordial Terror </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Causes the target opponent to flee in fear for a short time, and then prevents movement on the target after the fear expires. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Watery Horror </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants enduring breath and a damage shield that deals disease damage over time if hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Malefic Shroud </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Wards the target that deals disease damage to the attacker and heals the target for the same amount. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Turgurs Instant Relief </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Temporarily forces another person to be sick. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">40.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Bane of Shielding </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment placed on a target opponent that has a chance to ward the defender and does instant Disease damage to the attacker (target of the impairment). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Devitalizing Chant </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect hate reducer, also drains power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Eerie Avenger </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Prevents death by healing the target at the time of death. Summons a shadow that attacks the attacker. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Carrion Shield </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ward that deals disease damage to the attack and heals the target for the same amount. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mail of Souls </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Reduces Hate towards the caster and does instant Disease damage to the attack, converting a portion of this damage to Health replenishment on the caster. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">43 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Fetid Balm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instantly heals the target and grants a chance to proc damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">43.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Crystallize Soul </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment placed on a target opponent that creates a soul essence crystal in the caster&#39;s inventory if the target opponent is killed while the impairment is active. A soul essence crystal will replenish Health instantly on the user of the crystal. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Harbringer </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the targets hit points, power, and defensive skills. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ruinous Imprecation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals disease damage and reduces arcane and noxious resistances. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Aphotic Corruption </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals disease damage over time and lowers noxious resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Dread Invective </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Drains power over time and deals disease damage over time to the attacker. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Form of the Spirit Hawk </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Turns the caster into a hawk. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Dread Invective </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that has a chance to do Disease damage over-time and place an impairment on the target that does Disease damage each time the target consumes Power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Baleful Efflux </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups hit points and wards against poison. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Sacrificial Allevation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Instantly heals the target, but costs the caster health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Voractiy </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups strength and stamina, also has a chance to decrease attackers offenisve skills. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Ghastly Shroud </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the strength and ac of the group. Also has a chance to cause disease damage when attacked, that damage is converted into a heal which heals the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Loathsome Seal </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Decreases the strength, stamina, agility, and defense of the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">48 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Abhorrence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Decreases the targets intelligence, wisdom, and stregnth. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">48 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Malefic Countenance </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants wraith form. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Tendrils of Terror </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Slows an attacker and reduces agility when any group member is hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Maelstrom of Dismay </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Area of effect damage over time that gets converted into power &amp; health. The caster is immobilized and loses power over time while the effect is on. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Defiler </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Jukas Smoldering Essence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">? </td></tr></tbody></table>
	
